        id: 19,
        href: "http://localhost:1313/docs/leaderboard/",
        title: "Leaderboards",
        description: "Tasks docks",
        content: "\u003ch3 id=\"evaluation-metrics\"\u003eEvaluation Metrics \u003ca href=\"#evaluation-metrics\" class=\"anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e#\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\r\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003cthead\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:center\"\u003eTask\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:center\"\u003eMetrics\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:center\"\u003eEvaluation Script\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/thead\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003eLegal Named Entity Recognition (L-NER)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003estrict macro-F1\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://1drv.ms/f/s!AuBOJ2hW9Gimg6JhZWRMXL79k9Suig?e=1J4C6o\"\u003eLink\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003eRhetorical Role Labeling (RR)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003emacro-F1\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://1drv.ms/f/s!AuBOJ2hW9Gimg6JwZM61cExMmMAUig?e=pBlXK1\"\u003eLink\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003eCourt Judgment Prediction and Explanation (CJPE)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003emacro-F1,ROUGE-L\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://1drv.ms/f/s!AuBOJ2hW9Gimg6Jd2JJu22FzzlwGWA?e=DXm20B\"\u003eLink\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003eBail Prediction (BAIL)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003emacro-F1\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://1drv.ms/f/s!AuBOJ2hW9Gimg6JYHbhc7jVM5HTlUg?e=c8Op1j\"\u003eLink\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003eLegal Statute Identification (LSI)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003emacro-F1\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://1drv.ms/f/s!AuBOJ2hW9Gimg6JrvpZm-7AlhGX0lQ?e=yVCItn\"\u003eLink\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003ePrior Case Retrieval (PCR)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003emicro-F1@K\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://1drv.ms/f/s!AuBOJ2hW9Gimg6J8QRx8t2BXu7k4Bw?e=CIe3SB\"\u003eLink\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003eSummarization (SUMM)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003eROUGE-L/BERT-SCORE\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:center\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://1drv.ms/f/s!AuBOJ2hW9Gimg6J2JD12QUwyQZ7pIQ?e=STAPV8\"\u003eLink\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe encourage submissions for the IL-TUR leaderboard. The leaderboard is open to all researchers and practitioners.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c!-- The leaderboard is hosted on this webpage. The leaderboard is updated every 24 hours. --\u003e\n\u003ch4 id=\"the-leaderboard-can-be-accessed-herehttpshuggingfacecospacesexploration-labil-tur-leaderboard\"\u003eThe leaderboard can be accessed \u003ca href=\"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Exploration-Lab/IL-TUR-Leaderboard\"\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e. \u003ca href=\"#the-leaderboard-can-be-accessed-herehttpshuggingfacecospacesexploration-labil-tur-leaderboard\" class=\"anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e#\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\r\n\u003c!-- Every task has its own leaderboard, and researchers can submit their results for any task. We also encourage submissions for multiple tasks. --\u003e\n\u003c!-- For more details kindly visit our \u003ca href=\"/docs/submit/submit\"\u003eSubmission Page\u003c/a\u003e. --\u003e\n"
